0", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_1493244785719983_1226333999787569680_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ElYTnAZ9eg4Q7kNvwE5bGNh&_nc_oc=AdoThHZiJ44SL3EjYers-AGO3-5v1zqXcdHA6WGPh2ZqznDDWSBX5_vHIPh9LyhprrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR3_aCiyzUh84cEoRCpAA9_71pDjlQVYZyaaTIpgtCp5w&oe=6AF9E6A6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Infinite Wave - Invasion", "keywords": ["Shooter", "Survival", "Invasion", "Defense", "Tower"], "long_description": "# Infinite Wave\n\n**Infinite Wave** is a mixed reality **survival shooter** that transforms your\nreal room into a battlefield.\n\nUsing Meta Quest\u2019s room setup, your walls, furniture, and space become\npart of the game. Take cover behind your couch, move around your table,\nand defend your environment against relentless waves of robotic enemies.\n\n{1452957722497118}\n\nDesigned specifically for mixed reality, Infinite Wave blends digital\naction with your physical space, creating a unique experience every time\nyou play.\n\n{2687987704919603}\n\n# Key Features\n-   **Mixed Reality gameplay** in your real environment\n-   **Endless waves** of increasingly challenging robots\n-   **Physical movement** and positioning for survival\n-   **Score** system and competitive leaderboard\n-   **Clean sci-fi visuals** designed for comfort and clarity\n\n# Important\n-   Complete an accurate Room Setup\n-   Include all major furniture for best results\n-   This allows enemies and effects to properly interact with your space\n\n# Early Access / Alpha\n-   Infinite Wave is actively evolving with new features and\n    improvements\n-   Your feedback is important to shape the experience\n-   Please share feedback or report issues via email\n\n# Objective\n1.  Defend your space\n2.  Adapt to the waves\n3.  Push your limits", "short_description": "Step into Infinite Wave, a mixed reality robot invasion in your own room. Scan your space, turn furniture into cover, and survive relentless waves of enemies. Aim, shoot, and climb the leaderboard as each build evolves with new features. Set up your room accurately for the best experience\u2014and get ready to defend your reality."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.grunig.eu/infinitewave/pp/infinite-wave-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Josef Grunig", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.grunig.eu/infinitewave/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25966570129634909"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 8, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1069252245495662"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1039641985327453"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2336767470066346"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2228334237924756"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2369185003569954"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1567041921659304"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2356367918173584"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1715679673174432"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2228334237924756"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1792774800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1069252245495662"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29371327695825785", "version": "1.1.3"}, "id": "1640995263552835", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25966570059634916", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29371327695825785"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1640995263552835"}]}, "change_log": "New: the Gravity Glove (unlocks after wave 7)\n\n* With an empty hand, pull the trigger to grab an enemy with a gravity beam. Smash it into your walls, furniture and other enemies, or throw it. Impact kills score double.\n* Slingshot: while you hold an enemy, pull the thumbstick back to charge, then let go to launch it.\n* Tear enemies apart: grab the same enemy with both gloves and pull.\n* A new tutorial page explains it all.\n\nImprovements and fixes\n\n* The game pauses when the headset goes to sleep, comes off, or the system menu opens.\n* Turrets no longer keep shooting a bomb bot that has blown up, or get stuck on an enemy they can\u2019t hit.\n* The energy cell\u2019s buttons move with your squeeze again.\n* Bomb bot scoring fixed.", "created_date": 1794090140, "id": "29371327695825785", "version": "1.1.3", "version_code": 15, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25966570059634916", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29371327695825785"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1640995263552835"}]}, "change_log": "Version 1.1.2: more fronts, more firepower, a new flying enemy\nNEW\n\u2022 Drone Bot: a flying enemy from wave 46. It hovers around you, darts between positions and fires from the air. Shoot it down, or punch it out of the sky.\n\u2022 More fronts: a second cave opens at wave 35 and a third at wave 60, so enemies come at you from several directions.\n\u2022 Two new turrets: MK IV with twin gatlings after wave 40, and MK V, a long-range plasma cannon, after wave 50.\n\u2022 New checkpoints: Two Fronts, Bullet Storm, Eyes in the Sky, Full Arsenal and Three Fronts.\n\u2022 New tutorial page for the Drone Bot.\nSMOOTHER\n\u2022 Steadier frame rate in big waves: robots are much lighter to draw, and effects scale down automatically when the action gets heavy.\n\u2022 No more hitch when grabbing or swapping weapons.\n\u2022 Rooms and caves load much faster.\nFIXES\n\u2022 Turrets now land on open floor: no more turrets on furniture, hidden inside it, or stacked on top of each other when playing outdoors.\n\u2022 Shield Bot legs no longer stay stuck on walls or the ceiling, and debris rarely falls through the floor.\n\u2022 The laser turret's beam looks right at any distance.", "created_date": 1793360271, "id": "29249664681325421", "version": "1.1.2", "version_code": 13, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25966570059634916", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29371327695825785"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1640995263552835"}]}, "change_log": "Infinite Wave 1.1.0 \u2013 The Turret Update\n\nNew\n\nThree turret types (cannon, laser, twin cannons), unlocked at waves 10, 20 and 30\nEnergy: collect yellow cells to upgrade turrets (3 levels) and repair them\nEnemies now attack your turrets too\nNew checkpoint after wave 30\nHoloshield shortcut: press A or X\n\nImproved\nSmoother hand movement\nMore reliable room loading and a quicker Space Setup / Edit flow\nBetter performance with several turrets\nNew holoshield look; destroyed robots go up in smoke", "created_date": 1792334238, "id": "29084857684472789", "version": "1.1.0", "version_code": 11, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25966570059634916", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29371327695825785"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1640995263552835"}]}, "change_log": "* Complete UI redesign with improved layouts, readability, and visual consistency\n* Added Shield Bot, a new enemy capable of protecting nearby units with an energy shield\n* Optimized rendering, UI, and gameplay systems for improved performance and frame stability", "created_date": 1781537939, "id": "27523792737245966", "version": "1.0.7", "version_code": 8, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25966570059634916", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "29371327695825785"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1640995263552835"}]}, "change_log": "Added the Room Editor, allowing players to review and edit scanned room surfaces before playing.\n\nImproved cave spawn placement and validation, with better checks for invalid room positions and overlapping surfaces.\n\nFixed an issue that could make Bomb Bots difficult to grab by hand.\n\nImproved turret and scene item placement with safer ground detection and overlap prevention.\n\nFixed an issue where Bomb Bots could sometimes become stuck inside the cave.", "created_date": 1779221073, "id": "27183360844622492", "version": "1.0.6", "version_code": 7, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}